{%- comment -%}
  Row-Template -> Rebecca: what only a Rebecca page carries.

  tools/shell.mjs inserts this into the body, inside the autoescape block, just
  before the locale island. It names the panel, so the runtime polls
  /<token>/info and reads Rebecca's own vocabulary (src/scripts/live.js). A
  3X-UI page has no such element, and the runtime then behaves exactly as it
  always has. Rebecca has no announcement and no application list, so there is
  nothing else to carry.
{%- endcomment -%}
<div id="panel-data" hidden data-panel="rebecca"></div>
